# Backend modules

Each module under `backend/src/modules/` should include:

- `*.routes.ts` — Express Router, mount paths only
- `*.controller.ts` — req/res handling, use `sendSuccess` / throw `AppError`
- `*.service.ts` — business logic
- `*.model.ts` — Mongoose schemas
- `*.types.ts` — interfaces and DTOs
- `index.ts` — re-exports

Use centralized error middleware and `backend/src/utils/apiResponse.ts` for consistent JSON.

Log with the shared logger in `backend/src/utils/logger.ts`.
